            "value" : "使用你的 Glyph 清單追蹤每次 Glyph Hack，在你描繪時顯示序列。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off: only the item panels after each hack are read and counted. Your Glyph list stays saved." : {
      "comment" : "Settings footer: Glyph assistance off. Shown only once a Glyph list is loaded.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "オフ：各ハックのあとのアイテムパネルだけを読み取って数えます。グリフリストは保存されたままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
